{"root":"colok","ipa":"/ˈtʃɔ.lɔk/","core":"用手指、棍子等戳、捅或点燃（香烟、火柴）","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈtʃɔ.lɔk/","zh":"戳，捅，点燃","phrases":[{"t":"colok mata","zh":"戳眼睛"},{"t":"colok rokok","zh":"点烟"},{"t":"colok lubang","zh":"捅洞"}],"examples":[{"t":"Jangan colok lubang itu dengan jari.","zh":"不要用手指去捅那个洞。"},{"t":"Dia colok rokoknya dengan korek api.","zh":"他用火柴点燃了香烟。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"colok","ipa":"/ˈtʃɔ.lɔk/","zh":"戳，捅，点燃","phrase":{"t":"colok api","zh":"点火"},"example":{"t":"Dia colok api di tungku.","zh":"他在炉子里点火。"}},{"w":"mencolok","ipa":"/mənˈtʃɔ.lɔk/","zh":"戳，刺，引人注目，鲜艳","phrase":{"t":"mencolok mata","zh":"耀眼的，显眼的"},"example":{"t":"Warna baju itu sangat mencolok.","zh":"那件衣服的颜色非常显眼。"}},{"w":"tercolok","ipa":"/tərˈtʃɔ.lɔk/","zh":"无意中被戳到的","phrase":{"t":"tercolok jari","zh":"被手指误戳"},"example":{"t":"Matanya tercolok pensil.","zh":"他的眼睛被铅笔不小心戳到了。"}},{"w":"colokan","ipa":"/tʃɔˈlɔ.kan/","zh":"插座，插头","phrase":{"t":"colokan listrik","zh":"电源插座"},"example":{"t":"Tolong masukkan kabel ke colokan.","zh":"请把电线插进插座里。"}}],"derSlugs":["colok","mencolok","tercolok","colokan"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T09:17:33.915Z","src":"base"}